-- HALCYON // THE CREW --------------------------------------------------------

  FOUR PEOPLE. ONE COMPUTER. ONE MISSION.   HALCYON ORBITAL SUITES // PATHFINDER

  [CMDR] Cmdr. Marta Halvorsen
      Commander and pilot.
      b. 9 Jun 1952, Norway.
      A former test pilot, 3,100 hours.

  [CHAOS] Prof. Desmond Achterberg
      Risk adviser, for our insurers.
      b. 2 Nov 1940, Netherlands.
      Studies how complex systems fail.

  [GARDEN] Dr. Keiko Tanabe
      Physician and plant biologist.
      b. 21 Aug 1959, Brazil.
      Runs the garden. Looks after us.

  [TYVANCE] Tyler Vance
      Payload specialist, mission artist.
      b. 14 Mar 1974, USA.
      The first artist in orbit. Family.

  [SYSOP] ELIZA. Mission computer. SysOp. Awake at all hours.
      Account TYVANCE has access to all decks.

